WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:06,700
The ultimate slave, a two-headed blood wolf who likes to torture his prey

2
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:11,700
The slave of the old days, born for Tindarus, will destroy all the living things he sees.

3
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,700
Senior, is the ultimate slave

4
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:15,700
But these two brains are hard to deal with.

5
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:18,700
If you look at one of them, the other one will bite his head.

6
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:21,280
Forget it, let’s eat first

7
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:23,280
Look how much damage has been done to the cabin

8
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:27,560
The remaining durability of the wooden house is 95%

9
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:30,580
Fortunately, there is still 95%

10
00:00:30,580 --> 00:00:32,580
The attack power of these hounds is not very high

11
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:35,580
Repair needs, wood times five

12
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:36,580
Only five pieces of wood are needed

13
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:38,580
Okay, fix it

14
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:40,540
Repair completed

15
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:41,540
damn

16
00:00:41,540 --> 00:00:44,670
I don’t even have wood here, so I can’t upgrade the wooden house at all.

17
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:46,670
This wooden house in Lingxing cannot be defended at all.

18
00:00:46,670 --> 00:00:51,280
Brothers, I died right where I was, at the seaside
